'''Rainbringer seal''' is a water-type spell which generates rain.

==Description==
The rainbringer seal consists of a central water sigil with a rain sign surrounding it. When drawn, it creates a shower of rain.

==Usage==
This spell was never actually seen being used by anyone. However, it is known that this spell is one that [[Qifrey's Atelier|Qifrey's aprentices]] had commited to memory before the events that transpired within the [[Serpentback Cave]]. The rainbringer seal was seen in a mural of all the spells that the aprentices had in their arsenal when they were discussing a way to potentially turn [[Euini]] back into a human after he was afflicted with the [[Scalewolf Curse|scalewolf curse]].{{Ref|m|28|10}}

